!Name: p90sidelwss-4
!C A period 90 sideways LWSS rake.
!C This uses a period 45 forwards rake and a period 90 dirty puffer.
!C Every other glider from the rake hits a block and is turned into a
!C sideways LWSS.  The other glider hits the dirty output, which is
!C then deleted by some period 3 ships.
!C David I. Bell, October 1999
!Source: jslife-moving
!
